sequenceDiagram
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant CS as Care Service
    participant RS as Reminder Service
    participant NATS as NATS Event Bus

    %% Care Service communication
    AG->>CS: Handle bookings (create/update/fetch)
    CS-->>AG: Response (success/failure)

    %% Event bus notifications
    AG->>NATS: Publish booking events
    NATS-->>AG: Ack delivery
    Note right of NATS: Push notifications to subscribed clients

    %% Reminder Service communication
    AG->>RS: Create reminder
    RS-->>AG: Response (success/failure)
